---
import PhoneFrame from './PhoneFrame.astro';
---
<section class="magic" id="ai" aria-labelledby="magic-h">
  <div class="band__inner magic__inner">
    <div class="magic__copy reveal">
      <span class="eyebrow">✨ The AI magic</span>
      <h2 id="magic-h" class="magic__title">
        A full week, drafted in the time it takes to boil the <span class="accent-word">kettle</span>.
      </h2>
      <p class="magic__body">
        Kindred reads what’s in your stock, what your household has actually eaten, and any dietary
        notes you’ve set — then proposes a whole week. Approve it as is, shuffle a single night, or
        regenerate the lot. It’s a starting point you can shape, not a decision taken out of your hands.
      </p>
      <p class="magic__trustline">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-6"/></svg>
        <span>If a draft fails or you don’t like it, the AI credit comes back. You’re never charged for a miss.</span>
      </p>
      <p class="magic__privacy">
        Your data isn’t used to train anyone’s AI. More in our <a href="#faq">FAQ</a> and <a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a>.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-teal magic__cta" href="#final-cta">Try Plan Next Week — free for 14 days</a>
    </div>
    <div class="magic__media reveal">
      <PhoneFrame src="/images/03_recipe_create_with_ai.png" alt="Kindred’s Create with AI — drafting a recipe and its photo" variant="magic" />
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
